{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1th-3-1","title":"1 Thessalonians 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Saint Paul testifies his great love to the Thessalonians, partly by sending Timothy unto them to strengthen and comfort them; partly by rejoicing in their well-doing; 10 and partly by praying for them, and desiring a safe coming unto them.</p>\n<p>when. 5; 2:17; Jer 20:9; 44:22; 2Co 2:13; 11:29,30 we thought. Ac 17:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-3-2","title":"1 Thessalonians 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Timotheus. Ac 16:1; 17:14,15; 18:5 our brother. Ro 16:21; 1Co 4:17; 16:10,11,12; 2Co 1:19; 2:13; 8:23; Eph 6:21 Php 2:19-25; Col 1:7; 4:9,12 to establish. 13; Ac 14:22,23; 16:5; Eph 6:22; Php 1:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-3-3","title":"1 Thessalonians 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>moved. Ps 112:6; Ac 2:25; 20:24; 21:13; Ro 5:3; 1Co 15:58; Eph 3:13 Php 1:28; Col 1:23; 2Th 1:4; 2Ti 1:8; 1Pe 4:12-14; Re 2:10,13 we are. 5:9; Mt 10:16-18; 24:9,10; Lu 21:12; Joh 15:19-21; 16:2,33; Ac 9:16 Ac 14:22; 20:23; 21:11,13; Ro 8:35-37; 1Co 4:9; 2Ti 3:11,12 1Pe 2:21; 4:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-3-4","title":"1 Thessalonians 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>we told. Joh 16:1-3; Ac 20:24 even. 2:2,14; Ac 17:1,5-9,13; 2Co 8:1,2; 2Th 1:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-3-5","title":"1 Thessalonians 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>when. 1 I sent. 2,6; Ac 15:36; 2Co 7:5-7 lest. Mt 4:3; 1Co 7:5; 2Co 2:11; 11:2,3,13-15; Ga 1:6-9; Eph 4:14 Jas 1:13,14 and our. 2:1; Isa 49:4; Ga 2:2; 4:11; Php 2:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-3-6","title":"1 Thessalonians 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>when. Ac 18:1,5 and brought. Pr 25:25; Isa 52:7; 2Co 7:5-7 faith. 1Co 13:13; Ga 5:6; Col 1:4; 2Th 1:3; 1Ti 1:5; Phm 1:5; 1Jo 3:23 and that. 1:3; 2:9; 1Co 11:2; Col 4:18; 2Ti 1:3; Heb 13:3,7 desiring. 9,10; 2:17; Php 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-3-7","title":"1 Thessalonians 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>we were. 8,9; 2Co 1:4; 7:6,7,13; 2Jo 1:4 in all. Ac 17:4-10; 1Co 4:9-13; 2Co 11:23-28; 2Ti 3:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-3-8","title":"1 Thessalonians 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>we live. 1Sa 25:6; *Heb: Ps 30:5; Php 1:21 if. Joh 8:31; 15:4,7; Ac 11:23; 1Co 15:58; 16:13; Ga 5:1; Eph 3:17 Eph 4:15,16; 6:13,14; Php 1:27; 4:1; Col 1:23; Heb 3:14; 4:14; 10:23 1Pe 5:10; 2Pe 3:17; Re 3:3,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-3-9","title":"1 Thessalonians 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>what. 1:2,3; 2Sa 7:18-20; Ne 9:5; Ps 71:14,15; 2Co 2:14; 9:15 for. 7,8; 2:19 before. De 12:2,18; 16:11; 2Sa 6:21; Ps 68:3; 96:12,13; 98:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-3-10","title":"1 Thessalonians 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Night. Lu 2:37; Ac 26:7; 2Ti 1:3; Re 4:8; 7:15 praying. 11; 2:17,18; Ro 1:10; 15:30-32; Phm 1:22 might perfect. Ro 1:11,12; 2Co 1:15,24; 13:9,11; Php 1:25; Col 1:28; 4:12; 2Th 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-3-11","title":"1 Thessalonians 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>God. 13; Isa 63:16; Jer 31:9; Mal 1:6; Mt 6:4,6,8,9,14,18,26,32 Lu 12:30,32; Joh 20:17; 2Co 6:18; Col 1:2; 1Jo 3:1 and our Lord. Ro 1:3; 2Th 2:16 direct. or, guide. our way. Ezr 8:21-23; Pr 3:5,6; Mr 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-3-12","title":"1 Thessalonians 3:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>the Lord. 4:10; Ps 115:4; Lu 17:5; 2Co 9:10; Jas 1:17; 2Pe 3:18 abound. 4:9,10; Php 1:9; 2Th 1:3 love. 5:15; Mt 7:12; 22:39; Ro 13:8; 1Co 13:1-13; Ga 5:6,13,14,22; 2Pe 1:7 1Jo 3:11-19; 4:7-16 even. 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1th-3-13","title":"1 Thessalonians 3:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TH","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>he may. 5:23; Ro 14:4; 16:25; 1Co 1:8; Php 1:10; 2Th 2:16,17; 1Pe 5:10 1Jo 3:20,21 unblameable. Eph 5:27; Col 1:22; 1Jo 3:20,21; Jude 1:24 before. 11 at the. 2:19; 4:15; 5:23; 1Co 1:7; 15:23; 2Th 2:1 with. De 33:2; Zec 14:5; 2Th 1:10; Jude 1:14</p>"}]}